# Runtime + test dependencies for the CI "test" job, hash-pinned in
# test.txt so every pip install in .github/workflows is pinned (OpenSSF
# Scorecard Pinned-Dependencies). The package itself installs with
# --no-deps on top of this tree.
# Regenerate with: make pip-compile
-r runtime.in
